# The assessment of AGT-EXEC-005 against this build. The requirement identifier is this
# file's stem and appears nowhere inside it, because a second place to spell the identity
# is a second place for it to be wrong -- the rule OD-SPEC-007 chose for a record
# registration, and CHK-003.assessment states for this registry.
#
# AGT-EXEC-005: "Mutation operations shall support transaction previews, path constraints,
# replay/deduplication protection, explicit scope expansion, and rollback or repository
# recovery."
#
# Three of the five are real and tested in `nomos-corrections`. `Preview` renders exactly
# what a plan would do without ever touching a live workspace -- a transaction preview,
# tested deterministic across repeated calls. `Assert_Not_Stale`, run at staging, refuses a
# candidate whose declared prior content does not match what the workspace actually holds
# at that path -- a real path constraint, not merely a name check: `CorrectionPlan::New`
# separately refuses two candidates that touch the same path before either ever reaches a
# live workspace. `CommittedPlan::Rollback` undoes a committed plan back to the exact
# snapshot it started from, byte for byte, tested directly
# (`Test_Committing_Then_Rolling_Back_Should_Return_To_The_Base_Snapshot`) -- real rollback.
#
# The gap: the other two. Nothing in this crate protects against replaying or duplicating a
# plan -- `CorrectionPlan::New` carries no idempotency or replay key, so committing the
# same plan twice against two workspaces (or the same one, rebuilt) is indistinguishable
# from two independent corrections. And nothing supports explicit scope expansion -- a
# plan's candidates are fixed at construction; there is no operation that lets a staged or
# validated plan declare it now needs to touch more than it originally did.
verdict: Partial
site: crates/corrections/nomos-corrections/src/preview.rs#Preview
site: crates/corrections/nomos-corrections/src/staged.rs#Assert_Not_Stale
site: crates/corrections/nomos-corrections/src/committed.rs#Rollback
gap: crates/corrections/nomos-corrections/src/plan.rs#New
